      <rules>
        <rule name="Quick Reload" id="3ca7-8961-2c9d-8497" hidden="false" page="6" publicationId="79c4-b7d0-8643-3ab1">
          <description>Marksmen trained at the GunnerySchool are forced to practice many drills day afterday, including those that teach them to load their weapons for speed under high-pressure conditions.
Marksmen have the Hunter skill from the Mordheimrulebook.
A Marksman who becomes a Hero gains no further effect from taking the Hunter skill in additionto this.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
